  "meta": {
    "name": "cryon",
    "author": "Bowen-H0",
    "description": "\n[#7ec8e3]Project Farstar[] (formerly [#7ec8e3]Cryon Mod[]) is an expansion that takes you to brand new planets.\n\nThe first planet, [#7ec8e3]Cryon[], is a frozen world. You can carry resources to other sectors, just like in [accent]Serpulo[].\n\nOver [accent]100+[] new pieces of content! Including new ores, new machines, and new units.\n\n[accent]Development progress:[]\n- [#7ec8e3]Cryon[]: main campaign is [accent]complete[], and more content is still in development.\n- [accent]Aravis[]: new planet, [accent]in development[].\n\n\n[accent]Thanks for playing this mod!\nFeel free to report issues or suggest ideas: [lightgray]github bowen-H0[]\n\nSupported languages: [cyan]English[] / [cyan]中文[]\n\n[accent]Note:[] This mod was renamed from \"Cryon Mod\" to \"Project Farstar\". Your saves are safe.\n\n[#7ec8e3]远星计划[]（原名 [#7ec8e3]Cryon Mod[]）是一个带你前往全新星球的拓展模组。\n\n第一颗星球 [#7ec8e3]Cryon[] 是一个冰封世界。和 [accent]塞普罗[] 一样,你可以把资源带到其他区块。\n\n超过 [accent]100+[] 种全新内容!包括新的矿石、新的机器和新的单位。\n\n[accent]开发进度:[]\n- [#7ec8e3]Cryon[]:主线战役[accent]已完成[],更多内容仍在开发中。\n- [accent]Aravis[]:全新星球,[accent]开发中[]。\n\n\n[accent]感谢你游玩本模组!\n欢迎反馈问题或提出建议:[lightgray]github bowen-H0[]\n\n支持语言:[cyan]English[] / [cyan]中文[]\n\n[accent]注意:[]本模组已从 \"Cryon Mod\" 更名为 \"Project Farstar\"。你的存档不会受到影响。\n\n\nContributors:\nLSK133\nGary\n\n",
